        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As per <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3533347339\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41610\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41610/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41610\">#41610</a>, the information on our AI API documentation pages relating to <code class=\"notranslate\">destroy()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">abort()</code> is not accurate. This PR aims to fix this issue.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cc <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/nathanmemmott/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/nathanmemmott\">@nathanmemmott</a>. Can you give this a tech review?</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41610.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3533347339\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41610\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41610/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41610\">#41610</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
