        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4720081?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Methods to blank a canvas with a <code class=\"notranslate\">bitmaprenderer</code> context aren't obvious while reading MDN, according to the spec a <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code> bitmap is the way to go.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This conveys a way to clear the canvas directly from the main drawing method.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-imagebitmaprenderingcontext-transferfromimagebitmap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web reference link</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41711",
            "title": "Improve parameter documentation of `transferFromImageBitmap()`",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-27T17:01:52.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-27T17:01:29.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "AlaricSenat",
                "url": "https://github.com/AlaricSenat"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Pins all 3rd party GitHub Actions to specific commit hashes instead of version tags.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Each pinned action includes an inline comment with the resolved version number for reference.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Security best practice to pin actions to immutable commit hashes, preventing potential supply chain attacks from compromised action versions or tag hijacking.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See: <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions#using-third-party-actions\">https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions#using-third-party-actions</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3557620104\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1005\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/issues/1005/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1005\">mdn/fred#1005</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41710",
            "title": "ci(workflows): pin 3rd party actions",
