        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Rewrites the <code class=\"notranslate\">@supports font-format</code> example to fix the mistake.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fixes the color font example URL to link to a font file, not CSS.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">src</code> is a descriptor exclusive to <code class=\"notranslate\">@font-face</code>, not a property that can be set.</li>\n<li>Google Fonts serves CSS files at these URL, not font files.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Initially <a href=\"https://typo.social/@pixelambacht/115441236943309738\" rel=\"nofollow\">reported on Mastodon</a> by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/RoelN/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/RoelN\">@RoelN</a></p>",
