        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I came across the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ToggleEvent\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToggleEvent</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ToggleEvent/source\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToggleEvent.source</a> pages while reviewing <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41653\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41653/hovercard\">#41653</a> and noticed few opportunities where the text could be improved and made clearer.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'll leave inline comments to explain some of the specific changes.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41670",
            "title": "Editorial updates to ToggleEvent and ToggleEvent.source pages",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-27T10:39:03.000Z",
