        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF145 supports the HTTP headers <code class=\"notranslate\">Activate-Storage-Access</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">Sec-Fetch-Storage-Access</code> - and they are already supported in Chrome 133. This adds docs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Still working on it.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spec is <a href=\"https://privacycg.github.io/storage-access-headers\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://privacycg.github.io/storage-access-headers</a><br>\nRelated docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510237045\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41499\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41499/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41499\">#41499</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41614",
            "title": "FF145 Storage Access HTTP headers",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-27T06:45:33.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-21T06:38:56.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR addresses the dev-docs needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1886894\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1886894</a> Clear sessionStorage in browsingData.remove() for parity with \"Clear Cookies and Site Data\". It includes:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>a release note</li>\n<li>update to the <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingData.removeLocalStorage</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingData.remove</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingData.DataTypeSet</code> documentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related BCD changes in PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3537197220\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28261\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28261/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28261\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28261</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41609",
            "title": "Bug 1886894 Clear sessionStorage in browsingData remove options",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-21T16:06:47.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-20T17:43:11.000Z",
